"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13689","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/120066484"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=13689"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13689\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21780,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13689\/revisions\/21780"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/13693"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=13689"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=13689"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=13689"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=13689"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":13798,"date":"2022-04-28T19:14:33","date_gmt":"2022-04-28T19:14:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=13798"},"modified":"2023-06-07T09:50:51","modified_gmt":"2023-06-07T13:50:51","slug":"trading-for-gari-gmt-gst-msol-and-samo-starts-april-29-deposit-now","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/trading-for-gari-gmt-gst-msol-and-samo-starts-april-29-deposit-now","title":{"rendered":"Trading for GARI, GMT, GST, mSOL and SAMO Starts April 29  &#8211; Deposit Now!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"13857\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-inner-multi-token-4\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?fit=1536%2C701&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1536,701\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Inner &amp;#8211; Multi token\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-13857 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?resize=1536%2C701&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1536\" height=\"701\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?resize=768%2C351&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-2.png?resize=200%2C91&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports <\/span><b><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/gari-network\">Gari Network (GARI)<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/stepn\">STEPN (GMT)<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/green-satoshi-token\">Green Satoshi Token (GST)<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/marinade-sol\">Marinade SOL (mSOL)<\/a> <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/samoyedcoin\"><b>Samoyedcoin (SAMO)<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">!<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and Trading<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding is live, and trading will begin on <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">April 29 at approximately 18:30 UTC<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Keep an eye on the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/status.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">status page<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for updates.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can add these tokens to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting the asset, and hitting <\/span><b>Deposit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Deposits are near-instant.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All tokens are tradeable against <\/span><b>USD <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and <\/span><b>EUR<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/trade.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> interface with the following price precisions and minimum deposits:<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Asset<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Price precision\u00a0<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Minimum deposit<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GARI<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 GARI<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GMT<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">0.3 GMT<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 GST<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">mSOL<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">0.005 mSOL<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">SAMO<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">40 SAMO<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><b>Note:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Samoyedcoin (SAMO) trading is not available to residents of the United States, Canada and Japan.<\/b><\/li>\n<li><b>Trading via Kraken App and Instant Buy will be available once the liquidity conditions are met<\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market for their orders to be efficiently matched).<\/span><\/i><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know about the assets:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Gari Network (GARI) &#8211; <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gari Network aims to build a crypto-powered creator economy on the short-form video app Chingari. The GARI token incentivizes users to upload and engage with the platform\u2019s video content while also offering access to exclusive content. GARI token holders can also use their GARI to take part in the governance of platform operations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>STEPN (GMT) &#8211; <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GMT is the governance token for STEPN, a Web3-enabled &#8220;move-to-earn&#8221; fitness lifestyle app built on the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/solana\">Solana<\/a> blockchain. By walking, jogging, or running outdoors, STEPN users can earn the app\u2019s other cryptocurrency, Green Satoshi Token (GST), which is used to buy, rent, or level up their in-game sneakers from the game\u2019s marketplace. GMT can be burned to increase players\u2019 daily earning cap or increase their chances of earning higher quality in-game items.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Green Satoshi Token (GST) &#8211; <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Green Satoshi Token is the in-game currency of STEPN, a Web3 enabled &#8220;move-to-earn&#8221; fitness lifestyle app built on the Solana blockchain. Players first use GST to buy or rent sneakers, which are represented as NFTs, from the in-game marketplace. By walking, jogging or running outdoors, STEPN users earn GST, which can be used to level up or purchase new in-game sneakers.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Marinade SOL (mSOL) &#8211; <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marinade.finance is a non-custodial liquid staking protocol built on the Solana blockchain. After staking their SOL tokens on the Marinade protocol, users receive mSOL in return. mSOL can then be used across various DeFi services to execute trading or yield generating strategies and can be swapped back to SOL at any time<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Samoyedcoin (SAMO) &#8211; <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Samoyedcoin is an experimental Web 3.0 community coin built on Solana. Inspired by Dogecoin, Samoyedcoin was created with the aim to onboard, educate and develop a community for a new generation of crypto market participants.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken list more assets?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 not even which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s listed tokens are available on our website, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be listing in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee of executing at a certain price for a market order. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Listing an asset or token for trade is not a recommendation to buy, sell, or participate in the associated network. Do your own research and invest at your own risk.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports Gari Network (GARI), STEPN (GMT), Green Satoshi Token (GST), Marinade SOL (mSOL) and Samoyedcoin (SAMO)! Funding and Trading Funding is live, and trading will begin on April 29 at approximately 18:30 UTC. Keep an eye on the status page for updates. You can add these tokens to [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":13858,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789,1426],"tags":[1630,1631,1632,1633,1634],"language":[],"class_list":["post-13798","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","category-product","tag-gari","tag-gmt","tag-gst","tag-msol","tag-samo"],"yoast_head":"<