,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=13798"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":13848,"date":"2022-04-29T14:59:54","date_gmt":"2022-04-29T14:59:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=13848"},"modified":"2023-06-07T09:50:51","modified_gmt":"2023-06-07T13:50:51","slug":"centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now","title":{"rendered":"Centrifuge (CFG) Trading Starts April 29 &#8211; Deposit Now"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"13851\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/blog-inner-single-token-3\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?fit=1536%2C701&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1536,701\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Inner &amp;#8211; Single token\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-13851 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=1536%2C701&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1536\" height=\"701\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=768%2C351&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=200%2C91&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re excited to announce that Kraken now supports CFG!<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and Trading<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can add CFG to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting the asset, and hitting <\/span><b>Deposit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Trading will begin <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">April 29 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">at approximately 18H30 UTC.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know:<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ticker<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CFG<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tradeable against<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">EUR, USD<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Price precision<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4 decimal places<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Minimum deposit<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">0.18 CFG<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Deposit confirmations required<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">25 (~5 minutes)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Not available in<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">United States, Canada, Japan<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Services available<\/b><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/trade.kraken.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> interface<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3><b>What is CFG?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centrifuge is a decentralized finance (DeFi) lending protocol that aims to make credit more accessible to small businesses, while also providing a stable yield for investors by opening pooled liquidity to the world of traditional finance. CFG, Centrifuge\u2019s utility token, is essential to keeping the system secure and is used to pay transaction fees and for holders to help govern its software by voting on potential upgrades to it.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Want to learn more about how Centrifuge helps small businesses and traditional investors get started with Decentralized Finance (DeFi)? Check out Kraken Learn Center\u2019s article <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/what-is-centrifuge-cfg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What is Centrifuge?<\/span><\/i><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken list more assets?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 not even which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s listed tokens are available on our website, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be listing in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee of executing at a certain price for a market order. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Listing an asset or token for trade is not a recommendation to buy, sell, or participate in the associated network. Do your own research and invest at your own risk.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re excited to announce that Kraken now supports CFG! Funding and Trading You can add CFG to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting the asset, and hitting Deposit. Trading will begin April 29 at approximately 18H30 UTC. Here\u2019s what you need to know: Ticker CFG Tradeable against EUR, USD Price precision 4 decimal [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":13852,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789,1426],"tags":[1635],"language":[],"class_list":["post-13848","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","category-product","tag-cfg"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Centrifuge (CFG) Trading Starts April 29 - Deposit Now - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"ro