 Trading You can add CFG to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting the asset, and hitting Deposit. Trading will begin April 29 at approximately 18H30 UTC. Here\u2019s what you need to know: Ticker CFG Tradeable against EUR, USD Price precision 4 decimal [&hellip;]","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2022-04-29T14:59:54+00:00","article_modified_time":"2023-06-07T13:50:51+00:00","og_image":[{"width":730,"height":836,"url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-inner-Single-token.png?fit=730%2C836&ssl=1","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"krakenfx","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"krakenfx","Est. reading time":"2 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now"},"author":{"name":"krakenfx","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/461b7fbe1832d96cab8eb182c6642a21"},"headline":"Centrifuge (CFG) Trading Starts April 29 &#8211; Deposit Now","datePublished":"2022-04-29T14:59:54+00:00","dateModified":"2023-06-07T13:50:51+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now"},"wordCount":330,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cfg-trading-starts-april-29-deposit-now#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/Blog-inner-Single-token.png?fit=730%2C836&ssl=1","keywords":["CFG"],"articleSection":["Asset Listings","Product"],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/centrifuge-cf