wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?fit=1536%2C700&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1536,700\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Inner &amp;#8211; Single token\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-13927 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=1536%2C700&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1536\" height=\"700\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=768%2C350&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Single-token.png?resize=200%2C91&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re excited to announce that Kraken now supports NYM!<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and Trading<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can add NYM to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting the asset, and hitting <\/span><b>Deposit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trading will begin soon. Keep an eye on the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/status.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">status page<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for updates.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know:<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ticker<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NYM<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tradeable against<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">EUR, USD, <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">BTC<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b><br \/>\nPrice precision<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4 decimal places for EUR, USD\u00a0<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">8 decimal places for BTC<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Minimum order size\u00a0<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10 NYM<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Minimum deposit<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 NYM<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Deposit confirmations required<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Near instant<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Not available in<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">United States, Canada, Japan<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Services available<\/b><\/td>\n<td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/trade.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> interface<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><b>Note:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>This is the native NYM Cosmos token. Learn more about how to transfer your NYM ERC20 token to native NYM Cosmos in the <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.nymtech.net\/transfering-nym-erc20-to-nym-cosmos-for-bonding-or-delegating-in-nym-mainnet-introducing-gravity-821e417cb0ab\">Nym Tech official blog post<\/a> so you can deposit it in your Kraken account for trading.<\/b><\/li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Trading via Kraken App and Instant Buy will be available once the liquidity conditions are met<\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market for their orders to be efficiently matched).<\/span><\/i><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>What is NYM?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nym is an open-source, decentralized, and permissionless protocol that aims to provide full-stack data privacy for the next generation of the web. Through the Nym Mixnet, the protocol aims to obfuscate users\u2019 traffic and make it more difficult to track online activity. NYM token incentivizes the network to maintain consensus and allows token holders to govern the future development of the protocol.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken list more assets?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 not even which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s listed tokens are available on our website, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be listing in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee of executing at a certain price for a market order. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Listing an asset or token for trade is not a recommendation to buy, sell, or participate in the associated network. Do your own research and invest at your own risk.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re excited to announce that Kraken now supports NYM! Funding and Trading You can add NYM to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting the asset, and hitting Deposit. Trading will begin soon. Keep an eye on the status page for updates. Here\u2019s what you need to know: Ticker NYM Tradeable against EUR, USD, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":13928,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789,1426],"tags":[1636],"language":[],"class_list":["post-13925","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","category-product","tag-nym"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Nym (NYM) Is Available on Kraken - Deposit Now - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/nym-nym-is-available-on-kraken-deposit-now\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Nym (NYM) Is Available on Kraken - Depo