0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Blog Inner &amp;#8211; Multi token\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?fit=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-13960 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?resize=1536%2C701&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1536\" height=\"701\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?resize=300%2C137&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?resize=1024%2C467&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?resize=768%2C351&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Blog-Inner-Multi-token-1.png?resize=200%2C91&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports <\/span><b>Fetch.ai (FET) <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and<\/span><b> THORchain (RUNE)!<\/b><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and Trading<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding is live, and trading will begin on <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">May 6 at approximately 14:30 UTC<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Keep an eye on the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/status.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">status page<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for updates.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can add these tokens to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting the asset, and hitting <\/span><b>Deposit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Deposits are near-instant.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All tokens are tradeable against <\/span><b>USD <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">and <\/span><b>EUR<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/trade.kraken.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken Pro<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> interface with the following price precisions and minimum deposits:<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Asset<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Price precision\u00a0<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Minimum deposit<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FET<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">50 FET<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">RUNE<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 RUNE<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><b>Note:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Trading is not available to residents of Japan.<\/b><\/li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Trading via Kraken App and Instant Buy will be available once the liquidity conditions are met<\/b><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market for their orders to be efficiently matched).<\/span><\/i><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know about the assets:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Fetch.ai (FET) &#8211; <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fetch.ai is building a decentralized machine learning platform that enables anyone to share or exchange data. Fetch aims to create a new digital economy where people can bypass centralized aggregators by using software agents known as autonomous economic agents (AEAs). The FET token empowers users to pay for data requests on the network, vote on upcoming proposals and earn staking rewards.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>THORchain (RUNE) &#8211;<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> THORChain aims to decentralize cryptocurrency liquidity via a network of public THORNodes, which bond capital to secure the network. It offers a range of additional ecosystem products, such as wallets, aggregator tools and network explorers. RUNE is used to swap tokens, pay network fees and help secure the THORchain network.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken list more assets?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 not even which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s listed tokens are available on our website, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be listing in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee of executing at a certain price for a market order. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Listing an asset or token for trade is not a recommendation to buy, sell, or participate in the associated network. Do your own research and invest at your own risk.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports Fetch.ai (FET) and THORchain (RUNE)! Funding and Trading Funding is live, and trading will begin on May 6 at approximately 14:30 UTC. Keep an eye on the status page for updates. You can add these tokens to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting the asset, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":13961,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789,1426],"tags":[1444,1445],"language":[],"class_list":["post-13957","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","category-product","tag-fet","tag-rune"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Trading for FET and RUNE Starts May 6 - Deposit Now! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/trading-for-fet-and-rune-starts-may-6-deposit-now\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Trading for FET and RUNE Starts May 6 - Deposit Now!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports Fetch.ai (FET) and THORchain (RUNE)! Funding and Trading Funding is live, and trading will begin on May 6 at approximately 14:30 UTC. Keep an eye on the status page for updates. You can add these tokens to your Krake